  "pnpm-workspace.yaml lists '**', so the root package umami and packages/api-client and packages/mcp are three units, each with its own Vitest",
  "@playwright/test sits in dependencies, not devDependencies, yet it only runs the e2e tests",
  "@types/jest is a dev dependency but no Jest is installed: the tests run on Vitest",
  "vite is declared only as the engine of Vitest; the app is built by Next.js and the tracker scripts by Rollup",
  "ClickHouse appears only in docker-compose.test.yml and as CLICKHOUSE_URL; Redis and Kafka only as REDIS_URL, KAFKA_URL and their client packages; the deployable compose file starts PostgreSQL alone",
  "the Prisma schema writes its client to src/generated/prisma, which the sources import and the repository does not hold",
  "Heroku, Netlify and Vercel are deployment targets named only by app.json, netlify.toml and vercel.json",
  "only frameworks and services are measured; the other facets are in unknown"
 ],
